# Local server settings. Create .env.local from this file (Git ignores .env.local) and put the values there, never here.
# Where each key comes from: docs/local-development.md.
# Do not set LOVABLE_API_KEY locally: when it is set, AI calls go to Lovable's gateway.

# Server-only secret of the Supabase project named in .env. It bypasses row-level security.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# Your own key from the Development workspace in Estim's Anthropic organization.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Uncomment a line only together with a value: an empty value is not the same as unset.
# Salt for cached tender step results. A new value forces fresh, paid model calls.
# ANBUD_CACHE_SALT=
# Model for tender AI. Leave unset: Sonnet 5.5 and Opus 5.5 reject the forced tool calls with HTTP 400.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL_MAIN=
# 1 turns on the requirements engine in the quantity step. Off unless set to 1.
# ANBUD_REQUIREMENTS_ENGINE=
